OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 6 MAY
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,7,     Gfavourites.
OL,8,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,9,     GFrom Edinburgh's Usher Hall, the
OL,10,     GScottish Chamber Orchestra
OL,11,     Gconducted by Riccardo Minasi
OL,12,     Gplays Mozart's Requiem and
OL,13,     GHaydn's 'Mass In Time of War'.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: The Insect Singers
OL,15,     GThe Essay revels in the
OL,16,     Gmusicality and din of Earth's
OL,17,     Gloudest insect singers. Cicada
OL,18,     GSummer Song. Celebrated in verse,
OL,19,     Gsculpture and myth - from Japan
OL,20,     Gand China to Ancient Greece.
